" env classes live in the ``_experimental`` packages:"
msgstr "与基于 Torch 的管理器和环境类不同的 Warp 专属实现，位于 ``_experimental`` 包中："

#: source/concepts/warp_environment_migration.rst:44
msgid ""
"``isaaclab_experimental`` — warp managers, base env classes, warp MDP terms"
msgstr "``isaaclab_experimental`` — Warp 管理器、环境基类和 Warp MDP 项"

#: source/concepts/warp_environment_migration.rst:45
msgid ""
"``isaaclab_tasks_experimental`` — warp task configs and task-specific MDP "
"terms"
msgstr "``isaaclab_tasks_experimental`` — Warp 任务配置及任务特有的 MDP 项"

#: source/concepts/warp_environment_migration.rst:47
msgid ""
"Any new warp implementation that differs from the torch-based managers or "
"env classes belongs in these packages. Warp task configs reference Newton "
"physics directly (no ``PresetCfg``) since the warp path is Newton-only."
msgstr ""
"凡是与基于 Torch 的管理器或环境类不同的新 Warp 实现，都应放入这些包。Warp 路径仅支持 Newton，因此 Warp 任务配置直接引用 "
"Newton 物理配置，不使用 ``PresetCfg`` 。"

